WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:02,390
Are you satisfied?

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:03,930
Go down when you are satisfied

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:07,370
Don't forget what you promised me

4
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,500
Isn’t this the house that belonged to my hometown in Northeast China more than ten years ago?

5
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,540
But I'm obviously dead

6
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,460
Am I reborn?

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,910
Forgot Niuniu

8
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,310
Who are you trying to scare?

9
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,230
Li Changsheng also signed

10
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,390
I am reborn

11
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,300
Back to the day when Baldy Zhao came to collect debts

12
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:46,360
Li Changsheng, you're looking for death. I'll destroy the two dogs, Dashuan. He's so confused, go away.

13
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:49,570
It is only natural that Li Changsheng pay back his debts

14
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:50,730
Can you still rely on it?

15
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:58,140
Give me the contract. You want this contract. It's gone.

16
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:00,260
But I owe you three hundred dollars

17
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,300
I will give you this calendar in three days.

18
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:06,830
But if you dare to lay a finger on my wife and children again,

19
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:08,610
This is the end

20
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:09,970
Okay, you have the guts

21
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:11,930
I won’t be able to see three hundred yuan at this time the day after tomorrow.

22
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:13,650
Your wife and children all belong to us, let's go

23
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,020
three hundred yuan for three days

24
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:19,970
In this era when pork only costs 70 cents a pound,

25
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:21,410
This is a payment

26
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:39,460
As long as I enter the mountain, I will be the king. I haven't eaten yet. Boil the water and I'll go back. I'm lucky. There are rabbits.

27
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:41,060
Less than half an hour has passed
